    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d949">

                <pb facs="0744" n="662" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg662"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/1593.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American
                    Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                        1911</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Inform Diaz that the Government of the United States renews assurances of its
                    support in assisting his Government in so far as it properly may; that this
                    Government has taken note of his pledge to you—and therefore to this
                    Government—not to resign.</p>
                <p>Since Diaz is the constitutional President, recognized by this Government as
                    such, Mena must see it to be indispensable to his own interests that Diaz remain
                    in office.</p>
                <p>Impress Diaz with the value of harmony with Mena, so as to execute effectively
                    the pledges signed by him and Mena and delivered to Dawson.</p>
                <p>It would be the manifest duty of the United States Government to continue to
                    recognize the constitutional authorities in case of irreconcilable differences
                    between the Executive and any faction.</p>
                <p>Inform Diaz that the <hi rendition="#italic">Yorktown</hi> has been ordered from
                    Panama to watch for the reported filibuster and intercept her if warranted by
                    circumstances. Also that the Costa Rican Government has been informed of the
                    expected arrival of Espinosa and Moncada.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
